* 3D mode 7 with coupled die 1: after a successful drop die 1 gets the same 4x4 transform: 'Object 1 has been moved by drop positioning.'
* ORACLE: as predicted; workpiece and die 1 both moved by (0,0,-3.001) (die 1 net z 6.999); CNTRAX of both unchanged by the drop.
